.TH ORO-FS-DIR 3 "" "Oro Runtime" "Oro Runtime API Manual"
.SH NAME
oro:fs/dir \- JavaScript API module
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
import * as module from 'oro:fs/dir'
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
oro:fs/dir is a JavaScript API module exposed by the Oro Runtime.
.SH REFERENCE
.TP
\fBkType\fR
This is an exported `VariableDeclaration` named `kType`, but it does not yet have a dedicated description in the generated reference.
.TP
\fBsortDirectoryEntries(a, b)\fR
Sorts directory entries
\fBParameters:\fR
.br
\fIa\fR (string \\| Dirent; required)
.br
\fIb\fR (string \\| Dirent; required)
\fBReturns:\fR
.br
\fInumber\fR
.TP
\fBDir\fR
A containerr for a directory and its entries. This class supports scanning a directory entry by entry with a `read()` method. The `Symbol.asyncIterator` interface is exposed along with an AsyncGenerator `entries()` method.
.TP
\fBconstructor(handle, options)\fR
`Dir` class constructor.
\fBParameters:\fR
.br
\fIhandle\fR (DirectoryHandle; required)
.br
\fIoptions\fR (object; optional)
.TP
