Closes container and underlying handle.
\fBParameters:\fR
.br
\fIoptions\fR (object \\| function; required; default null)
.br
\fIcallback\fR (function; optional; default null)
.TP
\fBcloseSync(options)\fR
Closes container and underlying handle synchronously.
\fBParameters:\fR
.br
\fIoptions\fR (object; optional; default null)
.TP
\fBread(options, callback)\fR
Reads and returns directory entry.
\fBParameters:\fR
.br
\fIoptions\fR (object \\| function; required)
.br
\fIcallback\fR (function; optional)
